MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Hur_Arena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Hur_Arena_m01_001: Your second qualifier match is on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.\nPlease show up on the appointed date.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c05_Hur_Arena_m01: <BLN>Your next match...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Bon_m01_001: The more I learn of this city, the more fascinating\nI find it.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Bon_m01_002: For example, have you noticed the automatic lifts\nand gates?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Bon_m01_003: They seem to draw power from falling water stored\nin an upper reservoir.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Bon_m01_004: The scale of the mechanism is immense. Whoever\ndesigned it must be a genius.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c05_Bon_m01: <BLN>This is astounding.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Tob_m01_001: They say our next opponent's supposed to be\nincredibly strong.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Tob_m01_002: So it's kinda weird that even Bona, the Living\nArchive of Saramis, doesn't know who he is.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Tob_m01_003: Aww, but it'll be fine. You've got me on your\nside, boss!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c05_Tob_m01: <BLN>That's kinda weird.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01_001: If there's time before the match, I could make some\nextra cash by selling smoked meat.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01_002: There's gotta be some good hunting in the forests\naround here if we look.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01_003: If we're headed out of the city, Your Majesty, would\nyou mind if we poke around a bit?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01_004: <NCA>Agree to her request.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01_005: <NCB>Decline this frivolity.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01_006: <ACA>Wow, it's that easy? Guess it really never hurts\nto ask.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01_007: <ACB>Awww. But hey, you're the queen—what you\nsay goes.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c05_Lil_m01: <BLN>I wouldn't mind going hunting.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lys_m01_001: A truly staggering number of people live here.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lys_m01_002: Many of them are likely to be in poverty, which\ntends to lead to an increase in crime.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c05_Lys_m01_003: Right, then. Your Majesty, I'll do my part by\npatrolling the town.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c05_Lys_m01: <BLN>So many people...